  "description": "Whether you're doing a ground up build or upgrading your complete, the Haro Steel Reserve aftermarket frame is the perfect DJ platform. Built from 100% seamless chromoly tubing, with an integrated, tapered head tube and gusseted top and down tubes, it has 40mm more room in the front than previous versions for a ride that is smooth and stable on any terrain. A Euro bottom bracket with an invest cast yoke creates a rear end that is stiff and short (11mm shorter than our last frame) with plenty of crank, sprocket and tire clearance. Brazed on cable guides keep everything rattle free, with removable brake mounts for clean installation, no matter which brake option you choose. At the back, you get invest cast dropouts with built-in chain tensioners. For the skatepark, the pump track or hitting the biggest doubles you can find, the Steel Reserve frame is the starting point for the ultimate DJ build.",
